{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50228","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 錀匙 · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 錀匙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"开物务便成，通幽自有程。\n退藏缘遇暗，入用爲逢明。\n契理关潜受，知机力不争。\n赖因相启发，遂得振金声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}